  "_about": "an emu on the plains: the tall flightless bird of Australia -- a great rounded body under a shaggy coat of hair-like, drooping grey-brown feathers; the long neck, its upper half sparsely feathered over bare blue-grey skin, the dark-feathered head with its brown eye and short flat bill; the wings mere stubs hidden in the coat; long, thick scaly grey legs and three forward toes. (rework/bigbirds/bigbirds.py)",
